WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.209
Look at this map of all of

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:02.252
the places in the world

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.962
Vladimir Putin can't go

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:05.130
It's the countries in green.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:05.922
Let me explain.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.173
The International Criminal Court

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.384
is this court in the Netherlands

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:11.428
that is in charge of prosecuting,

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.470
like the worst war

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.680
criminals in our world.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.306
They recently put a warrant out

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.516
for the arrest of Vladimir Putin

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.101
for his war crimes in Ukraine,

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.936
which means that everyone who has signed

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:21.396
on to the International Criminal Court,

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.648
all of these countries, must arrest

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:24.357
Vladimir Putin

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.650
if he enters their country.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.818
And guess who just joined...

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.446
Russia's neighbor and old ally, Armenia.

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:30.363
Armenia did this

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.531
because they're worried

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:32.574
about a whole other issue

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.324
with Azerbaijan,

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:34.701
which I explained in another video.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.493
But in doing so,

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:37.287
they made Russia very angry

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.413
because they're basically validating

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.040
the court who wants to arrest

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.915
Vladimir Putin.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.542
Russia used to support Armenia,

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.002
but they've kind of been absent

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:44.753
lately, largely

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:46.004
because they're focused on Ukraine.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.005
So Armenia is like,

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.757
I have nothing to lose by signing on

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:50.050
and kind of estranging myself

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:50.633
with Russia.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:51.176
So, they signed on; they’re

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.385
part of the ICC.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.678
And Russia's not happy about it.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:54.429
If you want to understand

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:56.181
global politics, follow along for more.

